# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# THE SAFE RESTORE's question (v0.3, Evan 2026-10-30): a backup staged over USB (main_fm1.c; the host asks it here),
# the FM-1 asks RESTORE FROM USB? on the banner: SEL yes, HOME no, a minute without either no; while it asks, the
# panel does nothing else (a knob turned is dropped, HOME doesn't change the page). The flash's side, cut anywhere:
# tests/storage_test.c
notips
tap PLAY
wait 1500
expect view 0
expect par7 700
restoreask
wait 300
shot restore-ask.png
wait 1500
shot restore-keys.png
expect restore 0
spin K2 5
expect par7 700
tap HOME
expect restore 2
expect view 0
# asked again: SEL is yes
restoreask
wait 200
tap SEL
expect restore 1
# ... a minute without an answer: no
restoreask
wait 59000
expect restore 0
wait 1500
expect restore 2
# and the panel's its own again
spin K2 5
expect par7 750
